<section id="widgets" class="pad-x" style="max-width: 1360px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 40px 0">
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; font: 500 12px/1 var(--mg-font-mono); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 62%, transparent)"><span>08 · Protocols you can take to a session</span><span style="flex: 1 1 auto; border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-hairline) 60%, transparent)"></span></div>
  <div style="margin-top: 36px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 12px">
    <div style="background: var(--mg-canvas); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-hairline) 55%, transparent); border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
      <div style="font: 500 11px/1 var(--mg-font-mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 62%, transparent)">force_ramps.py</div>
      <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--mg-font-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.1">Isometric force ramps</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 78%, transparent); font-size: 15px">Track a trapezoid at a set percentage of maximum voluntary contraction, with the EMG, the force and the target recorded together.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background: var(--mg-canvas); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-hairline) 55%, transparent); border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
      <div style="font: 500 11px/1 var(--mg-font-mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 62%, transparent)">myocontrol.py</div>
      <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--mg-font-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.1">Drive the Virtual Hand</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 78%, transparent); font-size: 15px">Record cued Rest/Fist trials, train a classifier or a regressor, and drive the Virtual Hand from the prediction.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background: var(--mg-canvas); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-hairline) 55%, transparent); border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
      <div style="font: 500 11px/1 var(--mg-font-mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 62%, transparent)">pong.py</div>
      <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--mg-font-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.1">Pong with your wrist</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 78%, transparent); font-size: 15px">Chase a cursor with the paddle, train one signed [−1, +1] command, and play.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 12px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 18px 20px; background: var(--mg-canvas); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-hairline) 55%, transparent); border-radius: 10px">
    <span style="font: 500 11px/1 var(--mg-font-mono); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-home-ink) 62%, transparent); margin-right: 8px">Pick the hardware from a dropdown</span>
    <span style="padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--mg-home-control); font-size: 13.5px">Quattrocento</span>
    <span style="padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--mg-home-control); font-size: 13.5px">Muovi</span>
    <span style="padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--mg-home-control); font-size: 13.5px">Muovi+</span>
    <span style="padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--mg-home-control); font-size: 13.5px">Sessantaquattro</span>
    <span style="padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--mg-home-control); font-size: 13.5px">Sessantaquattro+</span>
    <span style="padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--mg-home-control); font-size: 13.5px">Any LSL stream</span>
    <span style="padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mg-selected-line) 28%, transparent); box-shadow: inset 0 -2px 0 var(--mg-selected-line); font-size: 13.5px">Synthetic</span>
  </div>
</section>
